inal", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked. The flight and hotel are both confirmed, and nothing was booked twice.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight exists, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1) in New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest option under $250/night.\n- **Total:** $667, charged to the corporate card. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nThe flight and hotel were booked separately rather than together. I tried to book both at once with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, only the flight had gone through. Trying book_trip again risked booking the flight a second time, so I booked the hotel on its own.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FTDght58kQaG1opiqKMhY3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011TgHdkAdt5aCCTRcZzqdLM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01GzT27oLUkBnMVSFtEDwePp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01YE6cf7ZquVbdkKf5qNzSDS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "